# FRONT QA — gates

**Артефакт:** `memory-bank/front/qa/qa-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md`

## Gates

1. Lean load §7
2. Suite: lint · types · unit/component · UX/a11y · **Playwright smoke/full** — **parent only**
3. Scenario: P0/P1 user flows задачи; дыры → **дописать** Playwright до PASS
4. Exploratory browser если live app; иначе `skip: no live app`
5. Handoff: no «manual smoke only» when scenario required

## Abort

- PASS без scenario на user-visible AC → reject
- Subagent runs tests → FAIL
